  "details": "I've been thinking about this REALLY cool idea, based around stickers, prints, emojis, all of that goodies.\n\nI feel like if a certain world has stickers or those such activated for their world, when you make a server for that world, you can have the option to have them available to use in the server for everyone. If its a Group Public, have the option to have only certain roles in the Group to be able to use stickers, emojis, etc. This could be really useful for fandom-based worlds that are for RP's and more! The instance owner could also turn permissions for those stickers, emojis and other stuff off. \n\nThat's all I can properly think of right now, thank you so much!",
